<https://wordlift.io/shacl/google/math-solvers/solvemathaction-eduquestiontype-missing> a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:property [ sh:message "Every SolveMathAction under a MathSolver's potentialAction should have an eduQuestionType." ;
